BEGIN;


-- Ford Ranger Super Duty 2026.50MY. Ford's specification sheet publishes a full
-- Vehicle Masses table for all four cab types, so the single-cab kerb figure that
-- was previously derived from GVM minus payload is now a published number: the
-- derivation gave 2,518 kg and the sheet publishes 2,518 kg. Unlike the 2026.50MY
-- Ranger brochure, this sheet's kerb basis is the STANDARD factory-fit equipment
-- combination rather than the lightest orderable one, so no optimistic-kerb
-- caveat applies. GVM 4,500 kg, GCM 8,000 kg, GAWR 1,900/2,800 kg and 4,500 kg
-- braked towing are common to all four.

-- Ford Ranger 4x4 cab-chassis, 2022MY launch brochure. Every row reconciles
-- exactly against GVM minus kerb weight. Ford publishes two payload figures per
-- variant: one from kerb weight (heaviest factory options) and one from minimum
-- kerb weight (lightest orderable options). The conservative kerb-weight pairing
-- is stored so a camper calculation never overstates remaining capacity.
-- Every row is needs_secondary_review because the document is 2022MY while the
-- current Australian range is 2026.50MY. The 4x2 grades are confirmed to exist
-- in this brochure but its 4x2 Vehicle Masses page is absent, so no 4x2 row is
-- recorded rather than inferring 4x2 mass from 4x4 figures.

-- Ford Ranger 4x4 pick-up (tub) variants from the same 2022MY brochure. These
-- are tub vehicles: a slide-on requires a verified engineered tray conversion,
-- matching how Kia Tasman, Silverado and Tundra are treated. Payload falls as
-- grade rises, from 1,052 kg on the XL Super Cab to 934 kg on the Sport V6.

-- Toyota HiLux. Payload values are arithmetic derivations from Toyota's
-- maximum kerb weight and GVM in the June 2026 official table.

-- Isuzu D-MAX 25.5MY: cab-chassis kerb mass excludes tray. The official table
-- supplies axle limits and genuine accessory tray dimensions.

-- Mazda BT-50, complete Australian range from the official payload calculator.
-- The calculator publishes two mass states per cab-chassis grade: bare chassis,
-- and with the Mazda standard tray fitted. The tray-fitted state is stored,
-- because a slide-on always sits on a tray and the bare figure overstates
-- remaining capacity. Tray mass is 144 kg on single cab, 125 kg on Freestyle
-- and 114 kg on dual cab. Pickup grades are tub vehicles and have no tray state.
-- The two rows previously seeded here (single cab 4x2 XS and XT) are superseded
-- by this block; their bare figures are preserved in the notes and match exactly.

-- Australian ute specifications supplied 18 August 2026 and independently
-- verified against the manufacturer documents where those were reachable:
-- Amarok, GWM Cannon, Cannon Alpha, Kia Tasman cab-chassis, Navara and the
-- RAM 2500/3500 sheet all matched to the kilogram. Ford F-150 and RAM 1500
-- could not be checked and carry needs_secondary_review.

-- Mitsubishi Triton, 26MY brochure Dimensions and Weights table. Replaces the
-- single 25MY model-level row, which could not be mapped to a drivetrain or
-- transmission. Every payload here reconciles exactly with GVM minus kerb mass.
-- GLS and GSR pick-ups are sold in 1.0 t and 0.9 t payload models that share a
-- kerb mass but carry different GVM, so each is stored as its own row.

-- LandCruiser 70 automatic cab-chassis rows are exact within Toyota's
-- approximate-weight convention.

-- Large pickups. Physical size is not a substitute for payload: the official
-- Tundra sheet and GMSV pages show materially different limits by grade/category.

-- Kia Tasman MY26 pickup variants. Included because the platform was absent
-- from the initial shortlist; all require tub-compatible fitment or conversion.

-- Heavy-overland chassis are intentionally isolated from the removable
-- slide-on table. Every seed row remains non-selectable until a body builder
-- or engineer validates the body, subframe, axle distribution and as-built mass.
  id, make, model, model_year_start, model_year_end, variant, cab_type,
  axle_configuration, drivetrain, engine, transmission, wheelbase_mm, gvm_kg,
  gcm_kg, front_axle_limit_kg, rear_axle_limit_kg,
  chassis_cab_front_mass_kg, chassis_cab_rear_mass_kg,
  chassis_cab_total_mass_kg, published_body_payload_kg, mass_basis,
  cab_to_rear_axle_mm, max_body_length_mm, max_body_width_mm,
  braked_towing_kg, licence_class_note, mounting_architecture_note,
  source_id, source_locator, verification_status, customer_selectable, notes
) VALUES
  ('unimog-u4023-au-current', 'Mercedes-Benz', 'Unimog', 2026, NULL, 'U 4023', 'day_cab', '4x4', 'engageable AWD', 'OM 934 LA; 170 kW / 900 Nm', NULL, 3850, 10300, NULL, 4600, 6000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mercedes-Benz publishes no kerb or unladen weight for this vehicle; permissible total weight and axle loads only', NULL, 4100, 2280, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Use a manufacturer-approved torsion-decoupling/special subframe; the official page describes torsion-free box-body mounting.', 'mercedes-unimog-u4023-au', 'Technical data and body-mounting sections', 'needs_secondary_review', 0, 'The Australian page currently exposes U 4023, not legacy U 300/U 400/U 4000 naming. Never infer loaded-body suitability from the model alone.'),

  ('iveco-daily4x4-my24-sc-3480', 'IVECO', 'Daily 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'Single Cab 3480', 'single_cab', '4x4', 'permanent AWD', '3.0L diesel; 132 kW / 430 Nm', '8-speed Hi-Matic automatic', 3480, 7200, 10500, 2700, 5000, 1935, 1033, 2968, 4232, 'Official chassis-cab kerb and payload; includes 75 kg driver and full fuel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3500, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Body and subframe must comply with the IVECO body-builder manual and preserve chassis articulation.', 'iveco-daily-4x4-my24-au', 'Weights and dimensions: single cab 3480 mm', 'source_verified', 0, NULL),
  ('iveco-daily4x4-my24-sc-3780', 'IVECO', 'Daily 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'Single Cab 3780', 'single_cab', '4x4', 'permanent AWD', '3.0L diesel; 132 kW / 430 Nm', '8-speed Hi-Matic automatic', 3780, 7200, 10500, 2700, 5000, 1898, 1080, 2978, 4222, 'Official chassis-cab kerb and payload; includes 75 kg driver and full fuel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3500, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Body and subframe must comply with the IVECO body-builder manual and preserve chassis articulation.', 'iveco-daily-4x4-my24-au', 'Weights and dimensions: single cab 3780 mm; one dimension row appears as 3870 and requires clarification', 'source_verified', 0, 'The specification header and summary use 3780 mm; one detailed dimension row appears transposed as 3870 mm.'),
  ('iveco-daily4x4-my24-sc-4175', 'IVECO', 'Daily 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'Single Cab 4175', 'single_cab', '4x4', 'permanent AWD', '3.0L diesel; 132 kW / 430 Nm', '8-speed Hi-Matic automatic', 4175, 7000, 10500, 2700, 5000, 1950, 1050, 3000, 4000, 'Official chassis-cab kerb and payload; includes 75 kg driver and full fuel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3500, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Body and subframe must comply with the IVECO body-builder manual and preserve chassis articulation.', 'iveco-daily-4x4-my24-au', 'Weights and dimensions: single cab 4175 mm', 'source_verified', 0, NULL),
  ('iveco-daily4x4-my24-cc-3480', 'IVECO', 'Daily 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'Crew Cab 3480', 'crew_cab', '4x4', 'permanent AWD', '3.0L diesel; 132 kW / 430 Nm', '8-speed Hi-Matic automatic', 3480, 7200, 10500, 2700, 5000, 2150, 1183, 3333, 3867, 'Official chassis-cab kerb and payload; includes 75 kg driver and full fuel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3500, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Body and subframe must comply with the IVECO body-builder manual and preserve chassis articulation.', 'iveco-daily-4x4-my24-au', 'Weights and dimensions: crew cab 3480 mm', 'source_verified', 0, NULL),
  ('iveco-daily4x4-my24-cc-3780', 'IVECO', 'Daily 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'Crew Cab 3780', 'crew_cab', '4x4', 'permanent AWD', '3.0L diesel; 132 kW / 430 Nm', '8-speed Hi-Matic automatic', 3780, 7200, 10500, 2700, 5000, 2125, 1218, 3343, 3857, 'Official chassis-cab kerb and payload; includes 75 kg driver and full fuel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3500, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Body and subframe must comply with the IVECO body-builder manual and preserve chassis articulation.', 'iveco-daily-4x4-my24-au', 'Weights and dimensions: crew cab 3780 mm', 'source_verified', 0, NULL),
  ('iveco-daily4x4-my24-cc-4175', 'IVECO', 'Daily 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'Crew Cab 4175', 'crew_cab', '4x4', 'permanent AWD', '3.0L diesel; 132 kW / 430 Nm', '8-speed Hi-Matic automatic', 4175, 7000, 10500, 2700, 5000, 2190, 1175, 3365, 3635, 'Official chassis-cab kerb and payload; includes 75 kg driver and full fuel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3500, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Body and subframe must comply with the IVECO body-builder manual and preserve chassis articulation.', 'iveco-daily-4x4-my24-au', 'Weights and dimensions: crew cab 4175 mm', 'source_verified', 0, NULL),

  ('isuzu-nps-75-175-4x4-day', 'Isuzu', 'NPS 75-175 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'NPS 75-175 4x4', 'day_cab', '4x4', 'part-time 4x4', '4HK1-TCS; 129 kW / 460 Nm', '6-speed manual', 3395, 7500, 11000, 3100, 6000, 1900, 972, 2872, 4628, 'Official cab-chassis total and axle distribution', 2792, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Use the current Isuzu body-builder guide; validate frame mounting, cab tilt and rear-axle load.', 'isuzu-nps-75-175-4x4-au', 'Model D34 mass and dimension tables', 'source_verified', 0, 'Rear technical axle capacity is 6,600 kg but tyre/load limit is 6,000 kg; the lower usable limit is stored.'),
  ('isuzu-nps-75-175-4x4-crew', 'Isuzu', 'NPS 75-175 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'NPS 75-175 4x4 Crew', 'crew_cab', '4x4', 'part-time 4x4', '4HK1-TCS; 129 kW / 460 Nm', '6-speed manual', 3395, 7500, 11000, 3100, 6000, 2025, 1127, 3152, 4348, 'Official cab-chassis total and axle distribution', 1762, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence and registration implications require confirmation', 'Use the current Isuzu body-builder guide; validate frame mounting, cab tilt and rear-axle load.', 'isuzu-nps-75-175-4x4-au', 'Model C34 mass and dimension tables', 'source_verified', 0, 'Rear technical axle capacity is 6,600 kg but tyre/load limit is 6,000 kg; the lower usable limit is stored.'),

  ('fuso-canter-fg-4x4-wide-cab-swb', 'Fuso', 'Canter 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'FG 4x4 Wide Cab SWB', 'day_cab', '4x4', 'selectable high/low-range part-time 4x4 with FUSO TF3 two-speed transfer', 'FUSO 4P10-T4 3.0L turbo-diesel; 110 kW / 370 Nm', 'FUSO M038S5 5-speed manual', 2815, 6500, 10000, 2800, 5760, 1740, 820, 2560, NULL, 'Fuso estimated mass: includes oil and water but excludes spare wheel, tools and fuel. Subject to plus or minus 3.5 percent variation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Light rigid licence required at 6,500 kg GVM. Fuso offers a 4,495/4,500 kg GVM derate that can be driven on a car licence; confirm the certified configuration before purchase.', 'Fuso body builder''s notes require chassis reinforcement for tipper or demountable body configurations. Obtain the Fuso body-builder directive before body design or mounting.', 'fuso-canter-fg-4x4-wide-cab-spec', 'Specification sheet page 4, "Mass estimated" and "Dimensions mm" tables, column A; max axle loading from page 2.', 'source_verified', 0, 'Mass is Fuso''s estimate, not a weighed figure: plus or minus 3.5 percent is plus or minus 90 kg on this variant, and the 100 litre fuel tank, spare wheel and tools are all excluded. Treat the delivered chassis as heavier than the stored number and weigh it before matching a camper. Cab-to-rear-axle and maximum body length are not published on the sheet; it gives front-axle-to-rear-of-cab and rear-axle-to-frame-end separately, and these are not derived here. Model codes FGB71CR6SFBC and FGB71CR6SFAC.'),
  ('fuso-canter-fg-4x4-wide-cab-mwb', 'Fuso', 'Canter 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'FG 4x4 Wide Cab MWB', 'day_cab', '4x4', 'selectable high/low-range part-time 4x4 with FUSO TF3 two-speed transfer', 'FUSO 4P10-T4 3.0L turbo-diesel; 110 kW / 370 Nm', 'FUSO M038S5 5-speed manual', 3415, 6500, 10000, 2800, 5760, 1750, 845, 2595, NULL, 'Fuso estimated mass: includes oil and water but excludes spare wheel, tools and fuel. Subject to plus or minus 3.5 percent variation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Light rigid licence required at 6,500 kg GVM. Fuso offers a 4,495/4,500 kg GVM derate that can be driven on a car licence; confirm the certified configuration before purchase.', 'Fuso body builder''s notes require chassis reinforcement for tipper or demountable body configurations. Obtain the Fuso body-builder directive before body design or mounting.', 'fuso-canter-fg-4x4-wide-cab-spec', 'Specification sheet page 4, "Mass estimated" and "Dimensions mm" tables, column B; max axle loading from page 2.', 'source_verified', 0, 'Mass is Fuso''s estimate, not a weighed figure: plus or minus 3.5 percent is plus or minus 91 kg on this variant, and the 100 litre fuel tank, spare wheel and tools are all excluded. Treat the delivered chassis as heavier than the stored number and weigh it before matching a camper. Cab-to-rear-axle and maximum body length are not published on the sheet; it gives front-axle-to-rear-of-cab and rear-axle-to-frame-end separately, and these are not derived here. Model codes FGB71ER6SFBC and FGB71ER6SFAC.'),
  ('fuso-canter-fg-4x4-wide-crew-cab-mwb', 'Fuso', 'Canter 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'FG 4x4 Wide Crew Cab MWB', 'crew_cab', '4x4', 'selectable high/low-range part-time 4x4 with FUSO TF3 two-speed transfer', 'FUSO 4P10-T4 3.0L turbo-diesel; 110 kW / 370 Nm', 'FUSO M038S5 5-speed manual', 3415, 6500, 10000, 2800, 5760, 1910, 915, 2825, NULL, 'Fuso estimated mass: includes oil and water but excludes spare wheel, tools and fuel. Subject to plus or minus 3.5 percent variation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Light rigid licence required at 6,500 kg GVM. Fuso offers a 4,495/4,500 kg GVM derate that can be driven on a car licence; confirm the certified configuration before purchase.', 'Fuso body builder''s notes require chassis reinforcement for tipper or demountable body configurations. Obtain the Fuso body-builder directive before body design or mounting.', 'fuso-canter-fg-4x4-wide-crew-cab-spec', 'Specification sheet page 4, "Mass estimated" and "Dimensions mm" tables, column single column; max axle loading from page 2.', 'source_verified', 0, 'Mass is Fuso''s estimate, not a weighed figure: plus or minus 3.5 percent is plus or minus 99 kg on this variant, and the 100 litre fuel tank, spare wheel and tools are all excluded. Treat the delivered chassis as heavier than the stored number and weigh it before matching a camper. Cab-to-rear-axle and maximum body length are not published on the sheet; it gives front-axle-to-rear-of-cab and rear-axle-to-frame-end separately, and these are not derived here. Model codes FGB71ER6WFAC and FGB71ER6WFBC.'),

  ('man-tgm-13-250-290-4x4-cc', 'MAN', 'TGM 4x4 RV', 2025, NULL, 'TGM 13.250-290 4x4 BL CH RV CC', 'short_cab', '4x4', 'engageable 4x4', 'D0836; 250-290 hp family', 'MAN TipMatic 12.12 OD AMT', 4250, 13000, 20000, 6300, 7800, 4123, 1682, 5805, 7195, 'Official chassis-cab mass including 90 kg driver, 90% fuel and operating fluids; +/-3%', 3809, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence required; registration and route implications require confirmation', 'Body/subframe design must follow MAN body-builder instructions for an engageable-transfer-case 4x4 chassis.', 'man-tgm-4x4-rv-au', 'CC cab chassis weights and dimensions', 'source_verified', 0, 'Source also lists 28,000 kg GCM; 20,000 kg is stored because the sheet says it applies with the engageable transfer case.'),
  ('man-tgm-13-250-290-4x4-tn', 'MAN', 'TGM 4x4 RV', 2025, NULL, 'TGM 13.250-290 4x4 BL CH RV TN', 'long_cab', '4x4', 'engageable 4x4', 'D0836; 250-290 hp family', 'MAN TipMatic 12.12 OD AMT', 4250, 13000, 20000, 6300, 7800, 4433, 1778, 6211, 6789, 'Official chassis-cab mass including 90 kg driver, 90% fuel and operating fluids; +/-3%', 3310, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence required; registration and route implications require confirmation', 'Body/subframe design must follow MAN body-builder instructions for an engageable-transfer-case 4x4 chassis.', 'man-tgm-4x4-rv-au', 'TN cab chassis weights and dimensions', 'source_verified', 0, 'Source also lists 28,000 kg GCM; 20,000 kg is stored because the sheet says it applies with the engageable transfer case.'),

  ('iveco-eurocargo-ml150e32w-4x4-3915', 'IVECO', 'Eurocargo 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'ML150E32W 4x4 Cab Chassis 3915mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '4x4', '4x4', 'IVECO Tector 7; 235 kW (320 hp) at 2500 rpm, 1100 Nm at 1250 rpm', '6S 1000 TO 6-speed manual', 3915, 15000, 19000, 5700, 10000, 3697, 1841, 5538, NULL, 'IVECO indicative weight with standard options, 180 litres of fuel, 30 litres of AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence required at 15,000 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route implications require confirmation.', 'Bolted and riveted parallel channel chassis, 420 MPa yield. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-eurocargo-4x4-ml150-au-spec', 'Specification sheet, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 3915 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the chassis table on the same sheet.', 'source_verified', 0, 'Unlike the T-Way sheets in the same range, this kerb basis already includes 180 litres of fuel, 30 litres of AdBlue and a driver, so it is the conservative figure rather than the flattering one, and the payload derived from it is closer to what the vehicle will really carry. Plus or minus 3 percent is still plus or minus 166 kg. Overall length 6,666 mm, rear overhang 1,358 mm, unladen frame height 1,228 mm, day cab. Maximum body length is not published; the sheet gives front-axle-to-back-of-cab as 385 mm including the filter, and that is not derived here.'),
  ('iveco-eurocargo-ml150e32w-4x4-4150', 'IVECO', 'Eurocargo 4x4', 2024, NULL, 'ML150E32W 4x4 Cab Chassis 4150mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '4x4', '4x4', 'IVECO Tector 7; 235 kW (320 hp) at 2500 rpm, 1100 Nm at 1250 rpm', '6S 1000 TO 6-speed manual', 4150, 15000, 19000, 5700, 10000, 3698, 1872, 5570, NULL, 'IVECO indicative weight with standard options, 180 litres of fuel, 30 litres of AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence required at 15,000 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route implications require confirmation.', 'Bolted and riveted parallel channel chassis, 420 MPa yield. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-eurocargo-4x4-ml150-au-spec', 'Specification sheet, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 4150 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the chassis table on the same sheet.', 'source_verified', 0, 'Unlike the T-Way sheets in the same range, this kerb basis already includes 180 litres of fuel, 30 litres of AdBlue and a driver, so it is the conservative figure rather than the flattering one, and the payload derived from it is closer to what the vehicle will really carry. Plus or minus 3 percent is still plus or minus 167 kg. Overall length 7,478 mm, rear overhang 1,935 mm, unladen frame height 1,238 mm, day cab. Maximum body length is not published; the sheet gives front-axle-to-back-of-cab as 385 mm including the filter, and that is not derived here.'),
  ('iveco-tway-6x6-ad380t45w-4500', 'IVECO', 'T-Way 6x6', 2026, NULL, 'AD380T45W 6x6 Cab Chassis 4500mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '6x6', '6x6 with TC 1800 two-speed transfer box', 'IVECO Cursor 13; 450 hp (331 kW) at 1900 rpm, 2200 Nm at 1000 rpm', 'Hi-Tronix 16TX 2240 TO 16-speed automated manual', 4500, 33500, 60000, 8000, 26000, 5589, 4668, 10257, NULL, 'IVECO indicative chassis tare mass with standard options, without fuel, AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy combination licence class required at 33,500 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route access require confirmation.', 'Chassis provides a CAN OPEN bodybuilder interface. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-tway-6x6-au-spec', 'Specification sheet, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 4500 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the "AXLE & SUSPENSION" table.', 'source_verified', 0, 'The stored mass excludes fuel, AdBlue and driver, and this chassis carries a 550 litre fuel tank: a full tank of diesel alone is roughly 460 kg the figure does not include. Plus or minus 3 percent is a further plus or minus 308 kg. Weigh the delivered chassis before matching a camper. Overall length 9,597 mm, day cab with low roof, 2,300 mm wide. Maximum body length is not published and is not derived here. At this GVM a slide-on camper is a small fraction of the available payload; the limiting factor will be the body and subframe design, not the mass.'),
  ('iveco-tway-6x6-ad380t45w-4200', 'IVECO', 'T-Way 6x6', 2026, NULL, 'AD380T45W 6x6 Cab Chassis 4200mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '6x6', '6x6 with TC 1800 two-speed transfer box', 'IVECO Cursor 13; 450 hp (331 kW) at 1900 rpm, 2200 Nm at 1000 rpm', 'Hi-Tronix 16TX 2240 TO 16-speed automated manual', 4200, 33500, 60000, 8000, 26000, 5550, 4660, 10210, NULL, 'IVECO indicative chassis tare mass with standard options, without fuel, AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy combination licence class required at 33,500 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route access require confirmation.', 'Chassis provides a CAN OPEN bodybuilder interface. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-tway-6x6-au-spec', 'Specification sheet, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 4200 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the "AXLE & SUSPENSION" table.', 'source_verified', 0, 'The stored mass excludes fuel, AdBlue and driver, and this chassis carries a 550 litre fuel tank: a full tank of diesel alone is roughly 460 kg the figure does not include. Plus or minus 3 percent is a further plus or minus 306 kg. Weigh the delivered chassis before matching a camper. Overall length 9,327 mm, day cab with low roof, 2,300 mm wide. Maximum body length is not published and is not derived here. At this GVM a slide-on camper is a small fraction of the available payload; the limiting factor will be the body and subframe design, not the mass.'),
  ('iveco-tway-6x6-ad380t45w-3800', 'IVECO', 'T-Way 6x6', 2026, NULL, 'AD380T45W 6x6 Cab Chassis 3800mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '6x6', '6x6 with TC 1800 two-speed transfer box', 'IVECO Cursor 13; 450 hp (331 kW) at 1900 rpm, 2200 Nm at 1000 rpm', 'Hi-Tronix 16TX 2240 TO 16-speed automated manual', 3800, 33500, 60000, 8000, 26000, NULL, NULL, 10154, NULL, 'IVECO indicative chassis tare mass with standard options, without fuel, AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy combination licence class required at 33,500 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route access require confirmation.', 'Chassis provides a CAN OPEN bodybuilder interface. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-tway-6x6-au-spec', 'Specification sheet, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 3800 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the "AXLE & SUSPENSION" table.', 'source_verified', 0, 'The stored mass excludes fuel, AdBlue and driver, and this chassis carries a 550 litre fuel tank: a full tank of diesel alone is roughly 460 kg the figure does not include. Plus or minus 3 percent is a further plus or minus 305 kg. Weigh the delivered chassis before matching a camper. Overall length 8,697 mm, day cab with low roof, 2,300 mm wide. Maximum body length is not published and is not derived here. At this GVM a slide-on camper is a small fraction of the available payload; the limiting factor will be the body and subframe design, not the mass. IVECO''s own sheet does not reconcile for this wheelbase: it prints 5,509 kg front and 4,654 kg rear against a 10,154 kg total, and those add to 10,163 kg. The published total is stored because payload is derived from it; the printed axle split is not stored at all, rather than recording a pair that contradicts it. The 4,500 and 4,200 mm columns on the same sheet both reconcile exactly.'),
  ('iveco-tway-8x4-ad410t51-5820', 'IVECO', 'T-Way 8x4', 2026, NULL, 'AD410T51 8x4 Cab Chassis 5820mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '8x4', '8x4 with TC 1800 two-speed transfer box', 'IVECO Cursor 13; 510 hp (375 kW) at 1900 rpm, 2300 Nm at 900 rpm', 'Hi-Tronix 16TX 2440 TO 16-speed automated manual', 5820, 41000, 60000, 16000, 26000, 6966, 3587, 10553, NULL, 'IVECO indicative chassis tare mass with standard options, without fuel, AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy combination licence class required at 41,000 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route access require confirmation.', 'Chassis provides a CAN OPEN bodybuilder interface. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-tway-8x4-au-spec', 'Specification sheet, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 5820 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the "AXLE & SUSPENSION" table.', 'source_verified', 0, 'The stored mass excludes fuel, AdBlue and driver, and this chassis carries a 550 litre fuel tank: a full tank of diesel alone is roughly 460 kg the figure does not include. Plus or minus 3 percent is a further plus or minus 317 kg. Weigh the delivered chassis before matching a camper. Overall length 10,019 mm, day cab with low roof, 2,300 mm wide. Maximum body length is not published and is not derived here. At this GVM a slide-on camper is a small fraction of the available payload; the limiting factor will be the body and subframe design, not the mass.'),
  ('iveco-tway-4x4-ad190t36w-4500', 'IVECO', 'T-Way 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'AD190T36W 4x4 Cab Chassis 4500mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '4x4', '4x4 with TC 1800 two-speed transfer box', 'IVECO Cursor 9; 360 hp (265 kW) at 2200 rpm, 1650 Nm at 925 rpm', 'Hi-Tronix 12TX 1810 TO 12-speed automated manual', 4500, 20500, 44000, 8000, 13000, 5077, 2403, 7480, NULL, 'IVECO indicative chassis tare mass with standard options, without fuel, AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence required at 20,500 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route implications require confirmation.', 'Chassis provides a CAN OPEN bodybuilder interface and a chassis-mounted jump start plug. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-tway-4x4-au-spec', 'Specification sheet page 4, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 4500 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the "AXLE & SUSPENSION" table on page 2.', 'source_verified', 0, 'The stored mass excludes fuel, AdBlue and driver, and this chassis carries a 550 litre fuel tank and an 80 litre AdBlue tank: a full tank of diesel alone is roughly 460 kg that the figure does not include. Plus or minus 3 percent is a further plus or minus 224 kg. Weigh the delivered chassis before matching a camper. The optional Cursor 13 engine adds 442 kg per the same sheet and is not stored as a separate row. Overall length 7,932 mm, rear overhang 1,780 mm, unladen frame height 1,181 mm, cab 2,300 mm wide day cab with low roof. Cab-to-rear-axle and maximum body length are not published; the sheet gives front-axle-to-back-of-cab as 480 mm (580 mm with the Cursor 13 or a vertical exhaust) and that is not derived here.'),
  ('iveco-tway-4x4-ad190t36w-4200', 'IVECO', 'T-Way 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'AD190T36W 4x4 Cab Chassis 4200mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '4x4', '4x4 with TC 1800 two-speed transfer box', 'IVECO Cursor 9; 360 hp (265 kW) at 2200 rpm, 1650 Nm at 925 rpm', 'Hi-Tronix 12TX 1810 TO 12-speed automated manual', 4200, 20500, 44000, 8000, 13000, 5061, 2322, 7383, NULL, 'IVECO indicative chassis tare mass with standard options, without fuel, AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence required at 20,500 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route implications require confirmation.', 'Chassis provides a CAN OPEN bodybuilder interface and a chassis-mounted jump start plug. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-tway-4x4-au-spec', 'Specification sheet page 4, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 4200 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the "AXLE & SUSPENSION" table on page 2.', 'source_verified', 0, 'The stored mass excludes fuel, AdBlue and driver, and this chassis carries a 550 litre fuel tank and an 80 litre AdBlue tank: a full tank of diesel alone is roughly 460 kg that the figure does not include. Plus or minus 3 percent is a further plus or minus 221 kg. Weigh the delivered chassis before matching a camper. The optional Cursor 13 engine adds 442 kg per the same sheet and is not stored as a separate row. Overall length 7,077 mm, rear overhang 1,195 mm, unladen frame height 1,181 mm, cab 2,300 mm wide day cab with low roof. Cab-to-rear-axle and maximum body length are not published; the sheet gives front-axle-to-back-of-cab as 480 mm (580 mm with the Cursor 13 or a vertical exhaust) and that is not derived here.'),
  ('iveco-tway-4x4-ad190t36w-3800', 'IVECO', 'T-Way 4x4', 2026, NULL, 'AD190T36W 4x4 Cab Chassis 3800mm wheelbase', 'day_cab', '4x4', '4x4 with TC 1800 two-speed transfer box', 'IVECO Cursor 9; 360 hp (265 kW) at 2200 rpm, 1650 Nm at 925 rpm', 'Hi-Tronix 12TX 1810 TO 12-speed automated manual', 3800, 20500, 44000, 8000, 13000, 5010, 2350, 7360, NULL, 'IVECO indicative chassis tare mass with standard options, without fuel, AdBlue and driver. Plus or minus 3 percent tolerance applies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heavy rigid licence required at 20,500 kg GVM; registration, mass limits and route implications require confirmation.', 'Chassis provides a CAN OPEN bodybuilder interface and a chassis-mounted jump start plug. Obtain the IVECO body-builder directive and confirm frame loading before body design or mounting.', 'iveco-tway-4x4-au-spec', 'Specification sheet page 4, "DIMENSIONS & WEIGHTS" table, 3800 mm wheelbase column; axle and suspension capacities from the "AXLE & SUSPENSION" table on page 2.', 'source_verified', 0, 'The stored mass excludes fuel, AdBlue and driver, and this chassis carries a 550 litre fuel tank and an 80 litre AdBlue tank: a full tank of diesel alone is roughly 460 kg that the figure does not include. Plus or minus 3 percent is a further plus or minus 221 kg. Weigh the delivered chassis before matching a camper. The optional Cursor 13 engine adds 442 kg per the same sheet and is not stored as a separate row. Overall length 6,672 mm, rear overhang 1,195 mm, unladen frame height 1,181 mm, cab 2,300 mm wide day cab with low roof. Cab-to-rear-axle and maximum body length are not published; the sheet gives front-axle-to-back-of-cab as 480 mm (580 mm with the Cursor 13 or a vertical exhaust) and that is not derived here.');

