-- Volkswagen Crafter 55 cab chassis, read from the Australian Crafter range
-- brochure (February 2021) supplied by the owner on 4 September 2026. All four
-- reconcile: 5500kg GVM minus unladen mass equals the published payload.
--
-- The Crafter 50 is not here: its GVM is 4490kg, ten kilograms under this table's
-- CHECK (gvm_kg > 4500). Two of its dual cab rows do not reconcile as printed
-- either (Dual MWB 2247/2295 and Dual LWB 2243/2195 against a 4490kg GVM), which
-- is worth resolving before anyone lowers that threshold.
--
-- model_year_start is deliberately NULL. The brochure states no model year, and
-- this file already forbids substituting the research access year for one. These
-- rows therefore cannot publish until a model year is established from a current
-- source; the build will name them in its skip list.
   'Commercial Vehicles: The Crafter Range',
   'https://www.volkswagen.com.au/idhub/content/dam/onehub_pkw/importers/au/pdfs/commercial-vehicles/Volkswagen_Crafter_brochure_Feb21.pdf',
   '2021-02', '2026-09-04', 'manufacturer_pdf', 'AU',
   'Supplied manually by the owner. Crafter 50/55 cab chassis weights on page 45. The brochure is dated February 2021 and states no model year, so it may be superseded; the current range page still lists Crafter 50 and 55.');

